# 🧮 1️⃣8️⃣ GATE Numerical

A noiseless channel has bandwidth **4 kHz** and **8 signal levels**.

Find maximum bit rate.

[
C=2B\log_2L
]

[
=2(4000)\log_2(8)
]

[
=8000\times3
]

[
\boxed{24,000\ bps}
]

---

# 🧮 1️⃣9️⃣ Another Numerical

A channel has bandwidth **2 MHz** and SNR = **20 dB**.

Convert SNR:

[
S/N=10^{20/10}=100
]

Shannon:

[
C=2\times10^6\log_2(101)
]

[
\log_2(101)\approx6.66
]

Therefore:

[
\boxed{C\approx13.32Mbps}
]

